  "notes": "{横領|おうりょう} is a legal term for misappropriating entrusted property.\n\nLEGAL TERMS:\n- {業務上|ぎょうむじょう}{横領|おうりょう}: occupational embezzlement\n- {横領|おうりょう}{罪|ざい}: crime of embezzlement\n- {横領|おうりょう}{事件|じけん}: embezzlement case\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {横領|おうりょう}する: to embezzle\n- {公金|こうきん}{横領|おうりょう}: embezzlement of public funds\n- {横領|おうりょう}が{発覚|はっかく}する: embezzlement is discovered\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {着服|ちゃくふく}: pocketing, embezzlement (less formal)\n- {使|つか}い{込|こ}み: misuse of funds",
